    "https://jobs.liu.edu/job_details/4366": {
      "title": "Student Worker - Student Run Businesses",
      "description": "LIU Job Opportunities Skip to main content JOBS.LIU.EDU Jobs at LIU Student Worker - Student Run Businesses Student Worker - Student Run Businesses No. 4366 Long Island University Brooklyn, New York Student Affairs-Brooklyn Posted Oct 15, 2026 $17 per hour Apply Now Save Job Share Job Details Job Type Work Study Student Salary Range $17 per hour Start Date As soon as possible FLSA Status Non-Exempt Application Deadline Apr 01, 2027 Contact Please submit an online application Job Description Position Summary: Student-run business sales ambassadors staff the various student-run businesses at the Brooklyn Campus, including Canteen. Sales ambassadors greet and assist customers, operate the point of sale (POS) system and assist with inventory management, maintenance of the facilities, and online order fulfillment. Duties and Principal Responsibilities: Operate the point of sale (POS) system to process orders, returns, and exchanges Utilize customer service skills to assist customers with any questions or concerns. Organize store inventory and displays to ensure the store is presentable and properly stocked. Assist in inventory labeling and fulfilling online sales orders. Communicate regularly with the Director of Student-Run Businesses. Education Requirements: LIU student enrolled in an\nactive degree program Rate of Pay : minimum hourly rate $17 HR Period of employment: Begin Date: now End\nDate: 9/2027 Evaluation procedures and schedules : Evaluated on a continuous basis by supervisor LIU is an equal opportunity employer. LIU is committed to\nextending equal opportunities in employment to all qualified candidates who can\ncontribute to the diversity and excellence of our academic community. LIU\nencourages applications from all qualified individuals without regard to race,\ncolor, religion, genetic information, sexual orientation, gender and/or gender\nidentity or expression, marital or parental status, national origin, ethnicity,\ncitizenship status, veteran or military status, age, disability, or any other\nbasis protected by applicable local, state or federal laws. Hiring is\ncontingent on eligibility to work in the United States. Back to All Jobs Quick Facts 3 Days Since Posted 2 Positions Available Work Study Student Employment Type Application Status Accepting Applications This position is currently accepting applications. © 2026 Long Island University - Human Resources HR@liu.edu An error has occurred. This application may no longer respond until reloaded. An unhandled exception has occurred. See browser dev tools for details. Reload 🗙"
