      "title": "Part Time Fire Watch",
      "description": "LIU Job Opportunities Skip to main content JOBS.LIU.EDU Jobs at LIU Part Time Fire Watch Part Time Fire Watch No. 5040 Long Island University Brookville, New York Tilles Center General Posted Oct 07, 2026 $35 - $40 an hour Apply Now Save Job Share Job Details Job Type Staff Salary Range $35 - $40 an hour Start Date As soon as possible FLSA Status Non- Exempt Application Deadline May 20, 2027 Contact Please complete online application Job Description Basic Function and\nScope of Responsibilities: The Tilles Center\nFire Watch is required to act as fire lookout when atmospheric stage effects\nrequire the alteration of the fire alarm system.  This is for select\nevents only as needed. Responsibilities: Fire Watch is to\nwork with LIU Post Electricians and Public Safety as well as other Fire Watch\nto patrol the venue for any fire during events with the public present and the\nFire Alarm system altered. Education\nRequirements: High School Diploma\nor Equivalent.  Prefer Fire Academy graduate. Qualification\nRequirements: Current active\nmember in good standing of a local fire department. Working Conditions: Generally indoors,\nin the theaters, auditoriums and backstage spaces at Tilles Center.  Some\noutdoor patrol and access to exterior fire alarm panels. Material and\nEquipment: Basic communications\ndevices. Back to All Jobs Quick Facts 12 Days Since Posted 1 Positions Available Staff Employment Type Application Status Accepting Applications This position is currently accepting applications. You Might Also Like Tilles Center Freelance Stagehand... #3028 Tilles Center General © 2026 Long Island University - Human Resources HR@liu.edu An error has occurred. This application may no longer respond until reloaded. An unhandled exception has occurred. See browser dev tools for details. Reload 🗙"
