    "https://jobs.liu.edu/job_details/4923": {
      "title": "Adjunct Instructor for Natural and Life Sciences Brooklyn",
      "description": "LIU Job Opportunities Skip to main content JOBS.LIU.EDU Jobs at LIU Adjunct Instructor for Natural and Life Sciences Brooklyn Adjunct Instructor for Natural and Life Sciences Brooklyn No. 4923 Long Island University Brooklyn, New York Natural Sciences Posted Sep 30, 2026 $1,000 - $1,350 per credit Apply Now Save Job Share Job Details Job Type Adjunct Faculty Salary Range $1,000 - $1,350 per credit Start Date As soon as possible FLSA Status Exempt Application Deadline Sep 01, 2027 Contact Please submit an online application Job Description Position Summary: Long Island University’s Brooklyn Campus seeks Adjunct Instructors in the Natural and Life \nSciences to teach undergraduate courses in disciplines such as biology, chemistry, physics, \nmathematics, and Health Science related fields. The successful candidate will demonstrate strong \nsubject matter expertise, a commitment to student-centered teaching, and the ability to foster an \nengaging and inclusive learning environment aligned with the University’s academic mission. Key Responsibilities include Deliver lectures and/or laboratory instruction Develop course \nmaterials and assessments Evaluate student performance Maintain regular \ncommunication with students and department faculty. Qualifications Master’s \ndegree in a relevant field Record of effective teaching or professional experience in the \nsciences. Pay Rates $1,000 - $1,350 per credit About LIU Brooklyn LIU\nBrooklyn campus enables students to realize their full potential as\nethically grounded, intellectually vigorous, and socially responsible global\ncitizens. The campus offers more professional programs in health care than any\nother campus in the New York metropolitan area, including the Arnold and Marie\nSchwartz College of Pharmacy & Health Science, and The Harriet Rothkopf\nHeilbrunn School of Nursing. LIU Brooklyn is home to Kumble Theater for the\nPerforming Arts, a dynamic performance venue designed to nourish students’\nartistic exploration, and Division I sports teams. LIU is an equal opportunity employer. LIU is committed to extending equal opportunity in employment to all qualified candidates who can contribute to the diversity and excellence of our academic community. LIU encourages applications from all qualified individuals without regard to race, color, religion, genetic information, sexual orientation, gender and/or gender identity or expression, marital or parental status, national origin, ethnicity, citizenship status, veteran or military status, age, disability or any other basis protected by applicable local, state or federal laws. Hiring is contingent on eligibility to work in the United States. Back to All Jobs Quick Facts 19 Days Since Posted 0 Positions Available Adjunct Faculty Employment Type Application Status Accepting Applications This position is currently accepting applications. You Might Also Like Adjunct Instructor - Natural & Life Sciences... #4429 Natural Sciences © 2026 Long Island University - Human Resources HR@liu.edu An error has occurred. This application may no longer respond until reloaded. An unhandled exception has occurred. See browser dev tools for details. Reload 🗙"
