    "https://jobs.liu.edu/job_details/5034": {
      "title": "Adjunct Professor for Bio Med Science",
      "description": "LIU Job Opportunities Skip to main content JOBS.LIU.EDU Jobs at LIU Adjunct Professor for Bio Med Science Adjunct Professor for Bio Med Science No. 5034 Long Island University Brookville, New York Bio Med Science Posted Sep 24, 2026 $1,000 - $1,350 per credit Apply Now Save Job Share Job Details Job Type Adjunct Faculty Salary Range $1,000 - $1,350 per credit Start Date As soon as possible FLSA Status Exempt Application Deadline Feb 01, 2027 Job Description The Biomedical Sciences section of Department of Diagnostic Health Professions at Long Island \nUniversity-Post campus is inviting applications for adjunct faculty to act as thesis mentors for MS \nlevel experimental or clinical thesis research. The MS in Biomedical Sciences program at LIU Post prepares students for future careers in \nmedicine, dentistry, pharmaceutical industries or research. You can find more details on the \nprogram here . Principal investigators or clinical researchers who can support and mentor student research in \nany area of biomedicine-including cancer biology, epidemiology, microbiology, immunology etc. \nare encouraged to apply. Faculty who work in the NY metropolitan area are preferred to allow \nhands-on training of the students. Please submit your CV and a cover letter indicating your willingness to act as a thesis mentor for \nLIU MS in BMS students.  \nAdjunct rank at time of appointment will be commensurate with experience.  \nFor questions, please contact Chair, Dr. Vinaya Sampath at Vinaya.sampath@liu.edu. LIU is an equal opportunity employer. LIU is committed to\nextending equal opportunities in employment to all qualified candidates who can\ncontribute to the diversity and excellence of our academic community. LIU\nencourages applications from all qualified individuals without regard to race,\ncolor, religion, genetic information, sexual orientation, gender and/or gender\nidentity or expression, marital or parental status, national origin, ethnicity,\ncitizenship status, veteran or military status, age, disability, or any other\nbasis protected by applicable local, state or federal laws. Hiring is\ncontingent on eligibility to work in the United States. Back to All Jobs Quick Facts 25 Days Since Posted 1 Positions Available Adjunct Faculty Employment Type Application Status Accepting Applications This position is currently accepting applications. You Might Also Like Adjunct Assistant Professor - Clinical Laboratory ... #4865 Bio Med Science © 2026 Long Island University - Human Resources HR@liu.edu An error has occurred. This application may no longer respond until reloaded. An unhandled exception has occurred. See browser dev tools for details. Reload 🗙"
