      "description": "LIU Job Opportunities Skip to main content JOBS.LIU.EDU Jobs at LIU Federal Work Study Student Worker - Kumble Theater Federal Work Study Student Worker - Kumble Theater No. 5031 Long Island University Brooklyn, New York Dean-RocNation School Posted Sep 23, 2026 $17 per hour Apply Now Save Job Share Job Details Job Type Work Study Student Salary Range $17 per hour Start Date As soon as possible FLSA Status Non-Exempt Application Deadline Dec 23, 2026 Contact Please submit an online application Job Description Summary Assists students and faculty with live sound and lighting needs, oversee theater use, and maintain operations during events and other bookings the space. Key Responsibilities Provide support for both sound and lighting, including audio mixing, DMX programming, and stage set ups. Assist clientele who have booked the space to ensure appointments are seamless and needs are met. Facilitate theater use for ongoing classes, workshops, events and recitals/showcases with instructors. Ensure both students and faculty are within theater guidelines and etiquette. Minimum Requirements LIU student enrolled in an active degree program LIU is an equal opportunity employer. LIU is committed to extending equal opportunity in employment to all qualified candidates who can contribute to the diversity and excellence of our academic community.  LIU encourages applications from all qualified individuals without regard to race, color, religion, genetic information, sexual orientation, gender and/or gender identity or expression, marital or parental status, national origin, ethnicity, citizenship status, veteran or military status, age, disability or any other basis protected by applicable local, state or federal laws.  Hiring is contingent on eligibility to work in the United States. Back to All Jobs Quick Facts 26 Days Since Posted 1 Positions Available Work Study Student Employment Type Application Status Accepting Applications This position is current