      "description": "LIU Job Opportunities Skip to main content JOBS.LIU.EDU Jobs at LIU Federal Work Study Student Worker Federal Work Study Student Worker No. 1342 Long Island University Brookville, New York Communications and Film Posted Sep 15, 2026 $17 per hour Apply Now Save Job Share Job Details Job Type Work Study Student Salary Range $17 per hour Start Date As soon as possible FLSA Status Non-exempt Application Deadline Jan 31, 2027 Contact Please submit an online application Job Description Name of the position: Student Worker Is this a Federal Work Study position? Yes Campus: Post Department Name and ID# :  Film and Media Department’s Dean and/or Director: Department Chair, Susan Zeig; Dean Maureen Tuthill Location: Building and Floor: Kahn Building, First floor, Film Equipment Room and Studio Supervisor: Name: Susan Zeig Title: Professor of Film, Department Chair Basic Function and Scope of Responsibilities These students are essential to maintain our equipment room and studio spaces These spaces are core parts of our working areas and essential to the running of our Film Program Duties and Principal Responsibilities: Signing equipment in and out to students for use in classes and on projects Maintaining equipment room and studio spaces in neat and orderly manner Making sure all returned equipment is in good order with all pieces accounted for Education Requirements : LIU student enrolled in an active degree program Period of employment : Evaluation procedures and schedules: Monthly meetings with Susan Zeig LIU is an equal opportunity employer. LIU is committed to extending equal opportunities in employment to all qualified candidates who can contribute to the diversity and excellence of our academic community. LIU encourages applications from all qualified individuals without regard to race, color, religion, genetic information, sexual orientation, gender and/or gender identity or expression, marital or parental status, national origin, ethnicity, citizenship status, veteran or military status, age, disability, or any other basis protected by applicable local, state or federal laws. Hiring is contingent on eligibility to work in the United States. Back to All Jobs Quick Facts 33 Days Since Posted 4 Positions Available Work Study Student Employment Type Application Status Accepting Applications This position is currently accepting applications. © 2026 Long Island University - Human Resources HR@liu.edu An error has occurred. This application may no longer respond until reloaded. An unhandled exception has occurred. See browser dev tools for details. Reload 🗙"
