      "description": "LIU Job Opportunities Skip to main content JOBS.LIU.EDU Jobs at LIU Student Worker - Student Run Business Student Worker - Student Run Business No. 4372 Long Island University Brookville, New York Student Affairs-Post Posted Sep 10, 2026 $17 per hour Apply Now Save Job Share Job Details Job Type Work Study Student Salary Range $17 per hour Start Date As soon as possible FLSA Status Non-Exempt Application Deadline Dec 31, 2026 Contact Please submit an online application Job Description Name of the position: Student Worker Is this a Federal Work Study position? Yes Classification of the position: Other Description : Student-Run Business Sales Ambassador Campus: Post Department Name and ID#: Dean of Students Department’s Dean and/or Director: Ashley John Location: Building and Floor: Hillwood Commons, Second Floor Title: Director of Student-Run Businesses Purpose or role of the position within the organization (Basic Function and Scope of Responsibilities): Student-run business sales ambassadors staff the various student-run businesses at the Post Campus, including the Shark Nation Spirit Store, Student Body Collective, and the Roosevelt House Gift Shop. Sales ambassadors greet and assist customers, operate the point of sale (POS) system and assist with inventory management, maintenance of the facilities, and online order fulfillment. Duties and Principal Responsibilities: Must be able to work special events. Upcoming special events include: Accepted Students Day, Open House, Commencement. Operate the point of sale (POS) system to process orders, returns, and exchanges. Utilize customer service skills to assist customers with any questions or concerns. Organize store inventory and displays to ensure the store is presentable and properly stocked. Assist in inventory labeling and fulfilling online sales orders. Communicate regularly with the Director of Student-Run Businesses. Education Requirements: LIU student enrolled in an active degree program Training, Skills, Knowledge, Experience: Rate of Pay : minimum hourly rate $17.oo per hour Period of employment: Begin Date: 07/01/2026 - 5/31/2027 Evaluation procedures and schedules : Evaluated on a continuous basis by supervisor LIU is an equal opportunity employer. LIU is committed to extending equal opportunities in employment to all qualified candidates who can contribute to the diversity and excellence of our academic community. LIU encourages applications from all qualified individuals without regard to race, color, religion, genetic information, sexual orientation, gender and/or gender identity or expression, marital or parental status, national origin, ethnicity, citizenship status, veteran or military status, age, disability, or any other basis protected by applicable local, state or federal laws. Hiring is contingent on eligibility to work in the United States. Back to All Jobs Quick Facts 39 Days Since Posted 10 Positions Available Work Study Student Employment Type Application Status Accepting Applications This position is currently accepting applications. You Might Also Like Event Assistant - Student Worker... #4774 Student Affairs-Post Federal Work-study Student Worker - Concierge... #1415 Student Affairs-Post © 2026 Long Island University - Human Resources HR@liu.edu An error has occurred. This application may no longer respond until reloaded. An unhandled exception has occurred. See browser dev tools for details. Reload 🗙"
