    "https://jobs.liu.edu/job_details/3230": {
      "title": "Federal Work Study Student Worker - Lifeguard",
      "description": "LIU Job Opportunities Skip to main content JOBS.LIU.EDU Jobs at LIU Federal Work Study Student Worker - Lifeguard Federal Work Study Student Worker - Lifeguard No. 3230 Long Island University Brookville, New York Pratt Recreation Center Posted Sep 08, 2026 $17.00 an hour Apply Now Save Job Share Job Details Job Type Work Study Student Salary Range $17.00 an hour Start Date As soon as possible FLSA Status Non-exempt Application Deadline Mar 01, 2027 Contact Please submit an online application Job Description Hours/Week: 5-17 hours per\nweek Prerequisite: Lifeguard\nTraining, First Aid, CPR for the Professional Rescuer/AED Minimum Qualifications: Current certifications in the\nfollowing: American\nRed Cross Lifeguard Training, CPR/AED for the Professional Rescuer and First\nAid Knowledge and Skills Thorough\nknowledge and application of lifeguard surveillance and rescue techniques An\nunderstanding of facility characteristics, rules, policies, and procedures Leadership\nand public relations skills Decision-making skills Description: Ensures\nthe safety of patrons of an aquatic facility by preventing and responding to\nemergencies. Maintains\nconstant surveillance of patrons in the facility; acts immediately and\nappropriately to secure safety of patrons in the event of an emergency. Provides\nemergency care and treatment as required until the arrival of emergency medical\nservices. Presents\nprofessional appearance and attitude at all times, and maintains a high\nstandard of customer service. Performs\nvarious maintenance duties as directed to maintain a clean and safe facility. Keep the\nmanagement well informed of pool maintenance needs including cleaning, chemical\nadjustments and repairs. Inventories and recognizes when supplies or equipment need to be ordered and\ncommunicates the needs to the director of special events Interacts with patrons\nregarding concerns, problems, or any other significant issues. Salary: $17.00 an hour LIU is an equal opportunity\nemployer. LIU is committed to extending equal opportunity in employment to all\nqualified candidates who can contribute to the diversity and excellence of our\nacademic community.  LIU encourages applications from all qualified\nindividuals without regard to race, color, religion, genetic information,\nsexual orientation, gender and/or gender identity or expression, marital or\nparental status, national origin, ethnicity, citizenship status, veteran or\nmilitary status, age, disability or any other basis protected by applicable\nlocal, state or federal laws.  Hiring is contingent on eligibility to work\nin the United States. Back to All Jobs Quick Facts 41 Days Since Posted 3 Positions Available Work Study Student Employment Type Application Status Accepting Applications This position is currently accepting applications. You Might Also Like Student Worker Concessions Assistant... #4260 Pratt Recreation Center © 2026 Long Island University - Human Resources HR@liu.edu An error has occurred. This application may no longer respond until reloaded. An unhandled exception has occurred. See browser dev tools for details. Reload 🗙"
