      "description": "LIU Job Opportunities Skip to main content JOBS.LIU.EDU Jobs at LIU Federal Work-study Student Worker - Concierge Federal Work-study Student Worker - Concierge No. 1415 Long Island University Brookville, New York Student Affairs-Post Posted Sep 04, 2026 $17 per hour Apply Now Save Job Share Job Details Job Type Work Study Student Salary Range $17 per hour Start Date As soon as possible FLSA Status Non-exempt Application Deadline Aug 31, 2027 Contact Please submit an online application Job Description Federal Work Study Student Worker, Part-time Campus:  LIU Post Basic\nFunction and Scope of Responsibilities: As a\nStudent Worker for Campus Concierge, you will serve as an information hub for all\nquestions regarding the campus. You will be required to field a wide range of\nquestions and lend assistance primarily to LIU Post students and visiting\nguests. Key responsibilities include providing excellent customer service to\nguests both on and off campus, greeting guests at the front desk, answering\nphones, opening and closing Hillwood Commons, collaborating with staff to\nresolve customer inquiries, ensure quality support is provided to LIU Post\nstudents, and other duties as assigned the office of Conference Services and\nLIU Promise. Principal\nResponsibilities: Provide excellent customer service to guests both on and off campus Greet guests at our front desk Answer phones Ensure\nquality support is provided to LIU Post students and guest. Open and close Hillwood Commons. Assist\nin walking/ guiding students to other buildings. Other\nduties as assigned the office. Education\nRequirements: Must be an\nLIU Post Student granted federal work study through Enrollment Services. Training,\nSkills, Knowledge, Experience: On-site\ntraining will be provided to all Student Workers during their first week of\nemployment. Working\nConditions: Student\nworkers will work at the Campus Concierge front desk and will provided a phone\nto assist with daily operations of our office. Materials\n& Equipment: You will be provided with a work shirt that\nmust be worn on your shifts. Salary:  $17 per hour Back to All Jobs Quick Facts 45 Days Since Posted 5 Positions Available Work Study Student Employment Type Application Status Accepting Applications This position is currently accepting applications. You Might Also Like Event Assistant - Student Worker... #4774 Student Affairs-Post Student Worker - Student Run Business... #4372 Student Affairs-Post © 2026 Long Island University - Human Resources HR@liu.edu An error has occurred. This application may no longer respond until reloaded. An unhandled exception has occurred. See browser dev tools for details. Reload 🗙"
