      "title": "Advantage Program Instructor",
      "description": "LIU Job Opportunities Skip to main content JOBS.LIU.EDU Jobs at LIU Advantage Program Instructor Advantage Program Instructor No. 5018 Long Island University Brooklyn, New York Community Grants & Partnership Posted Sep 04, 2026 $40 an hour Apply Now Save Job Share Job Details Job Type Administrative Salary Range $40 an hour Start Date As soon as possible FLSA Status Non-Exempt Application Deadline Dec 04, 2026 Contact Please submit an online application Job Description Summary Seeking an engaging Instructor to lead academic or enrichment activities in the after-school program, inspire student participation, deliver high-quality instruction, and support student development through sports, dance, art, math, and other educational programming. Programming occurs at MS 113 The Ronald Edmonds Learning Center.   Flexible work schedule. Key Responsibilities Facilitate an enrichment arts program or academic instruction. Assist in student recruitment. Prepare required reports, surveys, and attendance forms; maintain appropriate records. Keep informed of current trends in enrichment arts. Perform other duties as assigned by the Assistant Program Director. Minimum Qualifications Bachelor’s degree in education, Sports Management, or the Arts. Applicants must be proficient in MS Window XP, Word, Excel, Vista and Power Point. Three (3) years of instructional experience.  Experience in out-of-school programming. LIU is an equal opportunity employer.  LIU is committed to extending equal opportunity in employment to all qualified candidates who can contribute to the diversity and excellence of our academic community.  LIU encourages applications from all qualified individuals without regard to race, color, religion, genetic information, sexual orientation, gender and/or gender identity or expression, marital status, age, disability, or any other basis protected by applicable local, state, or federal laws.  Hiring is contingent on eligibility to work in the United States. Back to All Jobs Quick Facts 45 Days Since Posted 0 Positions Available Administrative Employment Type Application Status Accepting Applications This position is currently accepting applications. You Might Also Like Advantage Program Group Leader... #5017 Community Grants & Partnership Education Specialist... #5019 Community Grants & Partnership Advantage Program Assistant Director... #5020 Community Grants & Partnership © 2026 Long Island University - Human Resources HR@liu.edu An error has occurred. This application may no longer respond until reloaded. An unhandled exception has occurred. See browser dev tools for details. Reload 🗙"
