    "https://jobs.liu.edu/job_details/5010": {
      "title": "Adjunct Faculty – Doctor of Social Work (DSW)",
      "description": "LIU Job Opportunities Skip to main content JOBS.LIU.EDU Jobs at LIU Adjunct Faculty – Doctor of Social Work (DSW) Adjunct Faculty – Doctor of Social Work (DSW) No. 5010 Long Island University Brooklyn, New York Doctor of Social Work Posted Sep 03, 2026 $1,000–$1,350 per credit Apply Now Save Job Share Job Details Job Type Adjunct Faculty Salary Range $1,000–$1,350 per credit Start Date As soon as possible FLSA Status Exempt Application Deadline Dec 03, 2026 Contact Please submit an online application Job Description Summary The Doctor of Social Work (DSW) program at Long Island University is seeking part-time adjunct instructors to teach courses in its synchronous online program. Key Responsibilities Teaches assigned courses using approved curriculum materials. Provides regular, timely, and substantive feedback to students. Supports student progress toward course objectives and learning outcomes. Maintains consistent engagement in a synchronous online environment. Collaborates effectively with program faculty and staff. Minimum Qualifications Applicants must hold an MSW from a CSWE-accredited program. A doctorate in social work or a related field is preferred. Candidates should have a minimum of three years of post-MSW professional experience. Prior college-level teaching experience is preferred. Please submit the following with your application: A letter of interest, curriculum vitae, and contact information for three professional references. If you have any questions, please contact Dr. Sam Rosenberg at Samuel.Rosenberg@liu.edu. Long Island University is an equal opportunity employer and is committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive academic community. All qualified applicants will receive consideration without regard to race, color, religion, genetic information, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, marital or parental status, national origin, ethnicity, citizenship status, veteran or military status, age, disability, or any other protected status under applicable law. Employment is contingent upon eligibility to work in the United States Back to All Jobs Quick Facts 46 Days Since Posted 1 Positions Available Adjunct Faculty Employment Type Application Status Accepting Applications This position is currently accepting applications. © 2026 Long Island University - Human Resources HR@liu.edu An error has occurred. This application may no longer respond until reloaded. An unhandled exception has occurred. See browser dev tools for details. Reload 🗙"
