      "description": "LIU Job Opportunities Skip to main content JOBS.LIU.EDU Jobs at LIU FWS Student Worker - Respiratory Care FWS Student Worker - Respiratory Care No. 5006 Long Island University Brooklyn, New York Respiratory Therapy Posted Sep 02, 2026 $17.00/hour Apply Now Save Job Share Job Details Job Type Work Study Student Salary Range $17.00/hour Start Date 09/01/2026 FLSA Status Exempt Application Deadline Dec 02, 2026 Contact Marina Umanova, Program Director Job Description Purpose or role of the position within the organization (Basic Function and Scope of Responsibilities): Purpose or role of the position within the organization, basic function, and scope of responsibilities:\nTo provide general administrative and clerical support to the Respiratory Care Program and assist faculty and staff with the day-to-day operations of the department. Duties and Principal Responsibilities: Assist with filing, copying, scanning, organizing program materials, preparing documents, maintaining departmental records, and providing general office support to faculty and staff as needed. Education Requirements: LIU student enrolled in an active degree program Rate of Pay: NYS Hourly Minimum Wage Period of employment: Begin Date:  09/2026 - 05/30/2027 Back to All Jobs Quick Facts 47 Days Since Posted 0 Positions Available Work Study Student Employment Type Application Status Accepting Applications This position is currently accepting applications. © 2026 Long Island University - Human Resources HR@liu.edu An error has occurred. This application may no longer respond until reloaded. An unhandled exception has occurred. See browser dev tools for details. Reload 🗙"
