      "title": "Student Worker - Teaching Assistant",
      "description": "LIU Job Opportunities Skip to main content JOBS.LIU.EDU Jobs at LIU Student Worker - Teaching Assistant Student Worker - Teaching Assistant No. 4680 Long Island University Brooklyn, New York Psychology Doctoral Program (Brooklyn) Posted Aug 21, 2026 $17 per hour Apply Now Save Job Share Job Details Job Type Work Study Student Salary Range $17 per hour Start Date As soon as possible FLSA Status Non-Exempt Application Deadline Jan 01, 2027 Contact Please submit an online application Job Description Name of the position: Student Worker Is this a Federal Work Study position? Yes Classification of the position: Other Description :Teaching Assistant Campus: Brooklyn Department Name: Clinical Psychology Department’s Dean and/or Director: Meredith Kneavel Location: Building and Floor: Humanities 8 floor Supervisor: Name: Kevin B. Meehan Title: Program Director Purpose or role of the position within the organization\n(Basic Function and Scope of Responsibilities): STUDENT WORKER TEACHING ASSISTANT PHD PSYCHOLOGY Duties and Principal Responsibilities: Conduct independent sessions weekly. Provide experiential activities in sessions that illustrate various principles of the material taught. Provide assignments that enhance doctoral students’ knowledge Meet with individual students to establish competency in meeting profession standards. Assist instructor connected with the PhD course in class activities and laboratory exercises.  Provide support for PhD students enrolled in the course Education Requirements: LIU student enrolled in an\nactive degree program Training, Skills, Knowledge, Experience: MA degree in clinical psychology or equivalent; extensive experience with doctoral level courses; ideal candidate is enrolled in doctoral study in clinical psychology Rate of Pay : minimum hourly rate $17 HR Period of employment: Begin Date: End Date: 5/15/2027 Evaluation procedures and schedules : 13 total across both semesters  (note that some courses are 1 semester, and some courses are 2 semesters LIU is an equal opportunity employer. LIU is committed to\nextending equal opportunities in employment to all qualified candidates who can\ncontribute to the diversity and excellence of our academic community. LIU\nencourages applications from all qualified individuals without regard to race,\ncolor, religion, genetic information, sexual orientation, gender and/or gender\nidentity or expression, marital or parental status, national origin, ethnicity,\ncitizenship status, veteran or military status, age, disability, or any other\nbasis protected by applicable local, state or federal laws. Hiring is\ncontingent on eligibility to work in the United States. Back to All Jobs Quick Facts 58 Days Since Posted 2 Positions Available Work Study Student Employment Type Application Status Accepting Applications This position is currently accepting applications. You Might Also Like Student Worker - Assessment Team Psychological Ser... #4681 Psychology Doctoral Program (Brooklyn) Student Worker - Psychological Services Center Ass... #4682 Psychology Doctoral Program (Brooklyn) Student Worker - Assistant Psychology Dept... #4683 Psychology Doctoral Program (Brooklyn) © 2026 Long Island University - Human Resources HR@liu.edu An error has occurred. This application may no longer respond until reloaded. An unhandled exception has occurred. See browser dev tools for details. Reload 🗙"
