      "description": "LIU Job Opportunities Skip to main content JOBS.LIU.EDU Jobs at LIU Adjunct Assistant/Associate/Full Professor PT - Psychology/Clinical Psychology Doctoral Program Adjunct Assistant/Associate/Full Professor PT - Psychology/Clinical Psychology Doctoral Program No. 4156 Long Island University Brookville, New York Psychology Doctoral Program (Post) Posted Aug 21, 2026 $1,001-$1,350 per credit Apply Now Save Job Share Job Details Job Type Adjunct Faculty Salary Range $1,001-$1,350 per credit Start Date As soon as possible FLSA Status Exempt Application Deadline Jul 31, 2027 Contact Please submit an online application Job Description Title: PT Adjunct Position - Psychology/Clinical Psychology Doctoral Program Department: Clinical Psychology Doctoral program (POST) Campus: Brookville, New York Salary: $1,001-$1,350 per credit Starting Date: Varies with need; Contact: Please submit an online application. The School of Health Professions and the Department of Clinical Doctoral Psychology at the LIU\nPost Campus is currently seeking an adjunct instructor to teach lecture-based courses or lab\nsections. Applicants must hold a Master’s or higher degree in Psychology. Salary is commensurate with\nexperience and qualifications. Interested candidates should send a CV and contact information for three references. LIU is an equal opportunity employer. LIU is committed to extending equal opportunity in employment to all qualified candidates who can contribute to the diversity and excellence of our academic community. LIU encourages applications from all qualified individuals without regard to race, color, religion, genetic information, sexual orientation, gender and/or gender identity or expression, marital or parental status, national origin, ethnicity, citizenship status, veteran or military status, age, disability or any other basis protected by applicable local, state or federal laws. Hiring is contingent on eligibility to work in the United States. Back to