      "title": "FWS Student Athletics Equipment Assistant – Post",
      "description": "LIU Job Opportunities Skip to main content JOBS.LIU.EDU Jobs at LIU FWS Student Athletics Equipment Assistant – Post FWS Student Athletics Equipment Assistant – Post No. 4977 Long Island University Brookville, New York Athletics-General (Post) Posted Aug 18, 2026 $17 an hour Apply Now Save Job Share Job Details Job Type Work Study Student Salary Range $17 an hour Start Date 08/01/2026 - 06/30/2027 FLSA Status Non-Exempt Application Deadline Nov 30, 2026 Contact Complete Online application Job Description Basic Function and Scope of Responsibilities: The Student Equipment Room Assistant supports the Athletic Equipment Department by assisting with laundry operations, equipment and uniform distribution, inventory organization, and maintaining a clean and organized equipment room. The position also assists with preparing equipment and apparel for practices and competitions and supports daily equipment room operations as needed. Duties and Principal Responsibilities: The student equipment room assistant supports the daily operations of the Athletic Equipment Department by assisting with laundry services, equipment and uniform distribution, inventory management, and maintaining a clean and organized equipment room. Education Requirements: LIU student enrolled in an active degree program. Training, Skills, Knowledge, Experience: Rate of Pay: NYS Minimum Rate Evaluation, procedures and schedules: Performance wll be evaluated by the equipment manager based on attendance, punctuality, reliability, professionalism, initiative, teamwork, and successful completion of assigned game day responsibilities.  This position works a flexible schedule based on athletic event needs, with a maximum of 17 hours per week. LIU is an equal opportunity employer. LIU is committed to extending equal opportunity in employment to all qualified candidates who can contribute to the diversity and excellence of our academic community. We encourage applications from all qualified individuals regardless of race, color, religion, genetic information, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, marital or parental status, national origin, ethnicity, citizenship status, veteran or military status, age, disability, or any other basis protected by applicable laws. Hiring is contingent on eligibility to work in the United States. Back to All Jobs Quick Facts 61 Days Since Posted 1 Positions Available Work Study Student Employment Type Application Status Accepting Applications This position is currently accepting applications. You Might Also Like FWS Post Athletic Game Operations... #4988 Athletics-General (Post) Federal Work Study - Ticket Operations Post... #5024 Athletics-General (Post) Federal Work Study - Post Athletics Business Offic... #5044 Athletics-General (Post) © 2026 Long Island University - Human Resources HR@liu.edu An error has occurred. This application may no longer respond until reloaded. An unhandled exception has occurred. See browser dev tools for details. Reload 🗙"
