      "description": "LIU Job Opportunities Skip to main content JOBS.LIU.EDU Jobs at LIU Post Library Graduate Student Worker - FWS Post Library Graduate Student Worker - FWS No. 4119 Long Island University Brookville, New York Library (Post) Posted Aug 18, 2026 $17 per hour Apply Now Save Job Share Job Details Job Type Work Study Student Salary Range $17 per hour Start Date As soon as possible FLSA Status Non-Exempt Application Deadline Jan 18, 2027 Contact Please submit an online application Job Description Title: Graduate Student Worker – Library Services Department: Library (Post)\nCampus Salary: $17 per hour Starting Date: As soon as possible Contact: Please submit an online application Eligibility: Must be a graduate student enrolled in Palmer Library School. Graduate Assistant responsibility/duties • Assists librarians and support staff with daily library operations to help library users • Provides weekend/evening coverage (scheduling dependent on library needs) • Assists with reference services • Answers telephone • Assists with circulation services, including shelving and filing library materials • Assists patrons with computer and copier operation as necessary • Helps with projects • Other duties as assigned Requirements: • Palmer School MLS Graduate student • Weekend/evening availability LIU is an equal opportunity employer. LIU is committed to extending equal opportunity in\nemployment to all qualified candidates who can contribute to the diversity and excellence of\nour academic community. LIU encourages applications from all qualified individuals without\nregard to race, color, religion, genetic information, sexual orientation, gender and/or gender\nidentity or expression, marital or parental status, national origin, ethnicity, citizenship status,\nveteran or military status, age, disability or any other basis protected by applicable local, state\nor federal laws. Hiring is contingent on eligibility to work in the United States. Back to All Jobs Quick