      "title": "Adjunct Professor",
      "description": "LIU Job Opportunities Skip to main content JOBS.LIU.EDU Jobs at LIU Adjunct Professor Adjunct Professor No. 4645 Long Island University Brookville, New York Psychology (Post) Posted Aug 10, 2026 $1,000-$1,350 per credit Apply Now Save Job Share Job Details Job Type Adjunct Faculty Salary Range $1,000-$1,350 per credit Start Date As soon as possible FLSA Status Exempt Application Deadline Jan 29, 2027 Contact Please submit an online application Job Description Title: Adjunct Assistant Professor Department: BA of Psychology Reporting Relationship: Chairperson The Department of Psychology at LIU Post seeks adjunct faculty for undergraduate level\ncourses. The candidate should have specialized knowledge of and/or experience teaching in\nfields related to Psychology. The instructor will be expected to write lectures, prepare a syllabus\ndescribing course objectives, content, and the testing/grading plan, maintain a Brightspace course\nwebpage, upload student handouts to Brightspace, conduct classes in person, and be available for\nweekly office hours to assist students. Key Responsibilities: • Develop and instruct a undergraduate-level course, integrating the latest research and\ninnovative practices. • Collaborate with the chairperson and other faculty in the development of the course Qualifications: • A Master’s or PhD in Psychology, or a related field. • Demonstrated expertise applicable to the undergraduate level course Salary Range:$1,000-$1,350 per credit LIU is an equal opportunity employer. LIU is committed to extending equal opportunities in\nemployment to all qualified candidates who can contribute to the diversity and excellence of our\nacademic community. LIU encourages applications from all qualified individuals without regard\nto race, color, religion, genetic information, sexual orientation, gender and/or gender identity or\nexpression, marital or parental status, national origin, ethnicity, citizenship status, veteran or\nmilitary status, age, disability, or any other basis protected by applicable local, state, or federal\nlaws. Hiring is contingent on eligibility to work in the United States. Back to All Jobs Quick Facts 69 Days Since Posted 1 Positions Available Adjunct Faculty Employment Type Application Status Accepting Applications This position is currently accepting applications. © 2026 Long Island University - Human Resources HR@liu.edu An error has occurred. This application may no longer respond until reloaded. An unhandled exception has occurred. See browser dev tools for details. Reload 🗙"
