    "https://jobs.liu.edu/job_details/1737": {
      "title": "Hutton House Lecturer",
      "description": "LIU Job Opportunities Skip to main content JOBS.LIU.EDU Jobs at LIU Hutton House Lecturer Hutton House Lecturer No. 1737 Long Island University Brookville, New York Hutton House Lecture Series Posted Aug 07, 2026 $75.00 - $150.00 Hourly Apply Now Save Job Share Job Details Job Type Adjunct Faculty Salary Range $75.00 - $150.00 Hourly Start Date As soon as possible FLSA Status Exempt Application Deadline Nov 30, 2026 Contact Please submit an online application Job Description Hutton\nHouse Lectures is accepting proposals and applications for future lectures and\nlecture series offered on Zoom and on our stunning historic campus on the Gold\nCoast of Long Island. Hutton House Lectures is a distinguished lifelong\nlearning academy at Long Island University, a non-profit private university,\nthat presents over 300 non-credit lectures annually on Zoom and on site in Brookville,\nNew York. Our audience consists primarily of highly educated mature learners\nwho require stimulating lectures with thought leaders who are experts in their field. Our lectures are interdisciplinary\nand examine areas such as current events, politics, history, fine arts, music\nappreciation, English literature as well as cutting edge research in the field\nof health and wellness. Our faculty are from renowned universities and are known\nexperts in their fields. If you possess a passion for your discipline and are\nan expert in adult education, please emailed a Curriculum Vitae and persuasive\ncover letter including proposed lecture topics to the LIU School of Professional Studies c/o Karen.young@liu.edu . Retired university deans and faculty are\nwelcome. The Hutton House university educator should possess the\nfollowing qualifications: Bachelor’s, Master’s,\ndoctoral degree or equivalent experience in the field. Ability to\npresent quantitative and qualitative data and research-based content. Ability to impart\ninformation in an engaging, entertaining and thought-provoking manner. Excellent social\nand emotional skills are required. Knowledge of Zoom\nor online delivery of content preferred. Salary:  $75.00 - $150.00 Hourly LIU is an equal opportunity employer. LIU\nis committed to extending equal opportunity in employment to all qualified\ncandidates who can contribute to the diversity and excellence of our academic\ncommunity.  LIU encourages applications from all\nqualified individuals without regard to race, color, religion, genetic\ninformation, sexual orientation, gender and/or gender identity or expression,\nmarital or parental status, national origin, ethnicity, citizenship status,\nveteran or military status, age, disability or any other basis protected by\napplicable local, state or federal laws . Hiring is contingent on eligibility to work in the United States. Back to All Jobs Quick Facts 73 Days Since Posted 9 Positions Available Adjunct Faculty Employment Type Application Status Accepting Applications This position is currently accepting applications. © 2026 Long Island University - Human Resources HR@liu.edu An error has occurred. This application may no longer respond until reloaded. An unhandled exception has occurred. See browser dev tools for details. Reload 🗙"
