    "https://jobs.liu.edu/job_details/4260": {
      "title": "Student Worker Concessions Assistant",
      "description": "LIU Job Opportunities Skip to main content JOBS.LIU.EDU Jobs at LIU Student Worker Concessions Assistant Student Worker Concessions Assistant No. 4260 Long Island University Brookville, New York Pratt Recreation Center Posted Jul 24, 2026 $17 per hour Apply Now Save Job Share Job Details Job Type Work Study Student Salary Range $17 per hour Start Date As soon as possible FLSA Status Exempt Application Deadline Dec 24, 2026 Contact Please submit an online application Job Description FWS Concessions Assistant Position Basic Function and Scope of Responsibilities: This position is for a Concessions Assistant at the Pratt Recreation Center. This position is\nresponsible for providing a clean, safe & welcoming environment for all patrons. The Concessions\nAssistant works closely with the other Concessions Assistants, the Concessions Supervisor and the\nDirector of Campus Recreation. The responsibilities of this position include serving food and drinks,\nfollowing and enforcing food safety protocols and managing all equipment to ensure equipment and\nfood areas are sanitized, organized, and operating properly. Responsibilities: ● Handle and serve food and drinks to customers. ● Ensure the concession stand remains clean and sanitary. ● Utilize a POS system for sales. ● Adhere to Long Island University policies. ● Act in a professional manner by upholding LIU Policy when involved in conflict management with\npatrons, students, & staff. ● Perform opening/closing procedures of the concession stand. ● Display a positive and enthusiastic attitude for all patrons. Training, Skills, Knowledge, Experience: ● Interest or field of study related to management. ● Experience with serving food. ● Flexible hours, including weekends and evenings, are required to execute the position’s role\nresponsibly LIU is an equal-opportunity employer. LIU is committed to extending equal opportunity in employment to all qualified candidates who can contribute to the diversity and excellence of our academic community. LIU encourages applications from all qualified individuals without regard to race, color, religion, genetic information, sexual orientation, gender and/or gender identity or expression, marital or parental status, national origin, ethnicity, citizenship status, veteran or military status, age, disability or any other basis protected by applicable local, state or federal laws. Hiring is contingent on eligibility to work in the United States. Back to All Jobs Quick Facts 86 Days Since Posted 0 Positions Available Work Study Student Employment Type Application Status Accepting Applications This position is currently accepting applications. You Might Also Like Federal Work Study Student Worker - Lifeguard... #3230 Pratt Recreation Center © 2026 Long Island University - Human Resources HR@liu.edu An error has occurred. This application may no longer respond until reloaded. An unhandled exception has occurred. See browser dev tools for details. Reload 🗙"
