      "title": "Student Worker",
      "description": "LIU Job Opportunities Skip to main content JOBS.LIU.EDU Jobs at LIU Student Worker Student Worker No. 4635 Long Island University Brooklyn, New York Library (Brooklyn) Posted Jul 22, 2026 $17 per hour Apply Now Save Job Share Job Details Job Type Work Study Student Salary Range $17 per hour Start Date As soon as possible FLSA Status Non-Exempt Application Deadline Dec 22, 2026 Contact Please submit an online application Job Description Title: Federal Work Study Student Worker Campus : Brooklyn Location : LLC Building, 3rd Floor Supervisor: Martin Zimerman Description of Job: Provide assistance to the delivery of library services Duties/Responsibilities: Work in the library, including various library departments/units to assist with the provision of library services based on needs of the library. Special tasks and projects as assigned. Good communication skills Detail-oriented Customer service skills Follow instructions Basic computer skills Period of Employment : 9/2025-5/2026 Evaluation procedures and schedules: Evaluated on a continuous basis The successful candidate must be flexible and able to work between Monday and Sunday, including evenings, weekends, early mornings, and during extended hours service. LIU is an equal opportunity employer. LIU is committed to extending equal opportunity in employment to all qualified candidates who can contribute to the diversity and excellence of our academic community.  LIU encourages applications from all qualified individuals without regard to race, color, religion, genetic information, sexual orientation, gender and/or gender identity or expression, marital or parental status, national origin, ethnicity, citizenship status, veteran or military status, age, disability or any other basis protected by applicable local, state or federal laws.  Hiring is contingent on eligibility to work in the United States. Back to All Jobs Quick Facts 88 Days Since Posted 4 Positions Available Work Study Student Employ