    "https://jobs.liu.edu/job_details/3261": {
      "title": "Student Worker - Chemistry Lab Assistant",
      "description": "LIU Job Opportunities Skip to main content JOBS.LIU.EDU Jobs at LIU Student Worker - Chemistry Lab Assistant Student Worker - Chemistry Lab Assistant No. 3261 Long Island University Brookville, New York Natural Sciences Posted Jul 03, 2026 $17 per hour Apply Now Save Job Share Job Details Job Type Work Study Student Salary Range $17 per hour Start Date As soon as possible FLSA Status Non - Exempt Application Deadline Dec 31, 2026 Contact Please submit an online application Job Description Name of the position : Student Worker Chemistry Lab Assistant Campus : Post Department : Natural Sciences Location: Building and Floor: Pell Hall, 3rd floor Supervisor Name and Title: Hanying Bai, Lab Manager Basic Function and Scope of Responsibilities: Preparation, set up and clean jobs of chemical laboratory. Assistance of lab instructor and students during lab class. Handle and disposal chemical waste. Duties and Principal Responsibilities: Preparation, set up, clean up of chemicals, equipment and glassware for use in lab classes. Management of the collection and storage of chemical waste generated during lab classes. Preparation of unknown samples for student analysis. Assisting lab instructor and lab students during lab classes. Education Requirements : LIU student enrolled in an active degree program Training, Skills, Knowledge, Experience: Develop specialized skills in the proper preparation of chemicals and other lab instruments. the use of appropriate PPE and lab safety equipment. Rate of Pay: minimum hourly rate LIU is an equal opportunity employer. LIU is committed to extending equal opportunities in employment to all qualified candidates who can contribute to the diversity and excellence of our academic community. LIU encourages applications from all qualified individuals without regard to race, color, religion, genetic information, sexual orientation, gender and/or gender identity or expression, marital or parental status, national origin, ethnicity, citizenship status, veteran or military status, age, disability, or any other basis protected by applicable local, state or federal laws. Hiring is contingent on eligibility to work in the United States. Back to All Jobs Quick Facts 108 Days Since Posted 4 Positions Available Work Study Student Employment Type Application Status Accepting Applications This position is currently accepting applications. You Might Also Like FWS - Student Worker... #4448 Natural Sciences © 2026 Long Island University - Human Resources HR@liu.edu An error has occurred. This application may no longer respond until reloaded. An unhandled exception has occurred. See browser dev tools for details. Reload 🗙"
