    "https://jobs.liu.edu/job_details/4596": {
      "title": "Student Worker-Browse, Brooklyn Campus",
      "description": "LIU Job Opportunities Skip to main content JOBS.LIU.EDU Jobs at LIU Student Worker-Browse, Brooklyn Campus Student Worker-Browse, Brooklyn Campus No. 4596 Long Island University University Center - Brookville, New York President's Office Posted Jun 26, 2026 $17 per hour Apply Now Save Job Share Job Details Job Type Work Study Student Salary Range $17 per hour Start Date As soon as possible FLSA Status Non-Exempt Application Deadline May 28, 2027 Contact Please submit an online application Job Description Position Summary: Browse is LIU’s authorized technology store that offers discounted tablets, laptops, desktops, gaming consoles, and accessories to students, faculty, and staff with a valid LIU ID. As a student associate you will help with the daily operations of the store. Key Responsibilities: Student associates at Browse play a key role in daily operations while gaining hands-on experience alongside certified Help desk technicians. They develop skills in retail, customer service, business management, marketing, e-commerce, and tech support—valuable résumé builders before graduation. Students are also encouraged to visit Browse for Help desk support, including assistance with MyLIU account and password setup. Education Requirements: LIU student enrolled in an active degree program, and are eligible for Federal Work Study Rate of Pay : $17 per hour Period of employment: Begin Date: 09/2026, End Date: 5/2027 LIU is an equal opportunity employer. LIU is committed to extending equal opportunities in employment to all qualified candidates who can contribute to the diversity and excellence of our academic community. LIU encourages applications from all qualified individuals without regard to race, color, religion, genetic information, sexual orientation, gender and/or gender identity or expression, marital or parental status, national origin, ethnicity, citizenship status, veteran or military status, age, disability, or any other basis protected by applicable local, state or federal laws. Hiring is contingent on eligibility to work in the United States. Back to All Jobs Quick Facts 115 Days Since Posted 4 Positions Available Work Study Student Employment Type Application Status Accepting Applications This position is currently accepting applications. You Might Also Like Student Worker-Browse, Post Campus... #4595 President's Office © 2026 Long Island University - Human Resources HR@liu.edu An error has occurred. This application may no longer respond until reloaded. An unhandled exception has occurred. See browser dev tools for details. Reload 🗙"
